### 代码

* java

```java
class Solution {
    public String intToRoman(int num) {

        int[] money = {1000,900,500,400,100,90,50,40,10,9,5,4,1};
       
        String []str ={"M","CM","D","CD","C","XC","L","XL","X","IX","V","IV","I"};

        StringBuffer sbff =new StringBuffer();
        int i = 0;
        while(num!=0){

            if(num >= money[i]){
                sbff.append(str[i]);
                num -=money[i];
                
            }else{
                i++;
            }

            
            

        }


        return sbff.toString();
    }
}
```

